# Combo Pack / sheet-spec card description (learned 2026-09-25)

## Symptom

Dual-size Combo Pack (and similar) catalog **description** like  
`30×15mm | 24 Labels per Sheet + 46×15mm | 16 Labels per Sheet`  
wraps to **two lines** on laptop Stickers hub cards.

## Why

That string is stored in `product.description` (not a separate size field). `ProductCard` rendered all descriptions as `text-sm line-clamp-2`, so long sheet specs wrapped instead of staying a single spec row.

## Invariant

If description matches sheet-spec copy (`Labels per Sheet`), listing cards use **one line** + **smaller type** (`text-[11px] truncate`) and put the full string in `title` for hover. Marketing blurbs keep `text-sm line-clamp-2`.

Helper: `lib/stickerSheetSpecDescription.ts` → `isStickerSheetSpecDescription`.

## Do not

- Put dual-size specs only in `detailDescription` and leave card description empty without updating the card — hub reads `description`.
- Force all product descriptions to one line — only sheet-spec pattern.
- Use `object-cover` / image CSS to “fix” text wrap.
